description = "Hatari emulator for libretro. This core supports Atari's 16-/32-bit ST/STE/TT/Falcon hardware, floppy disk playlists, ACSI/IDE/SCSI hard-disk images, and GEMDOS host-directory content via a .gemdos loader file. It requires a TOS image to function."
